    <string name="oem_guidance_body">Some phones (Xiaomi, Oppo, Vivo, Huawei and others) force-stop apps to save battery. To make sure transfers keep running when the screen is off:\n\n1. Open system settings for MorseLink.\n2. Find Battery or Power usage.\n3. Choose No restrictions / Allow background activity (wording differs by brand).\n4. If there is an Autostart switch, turn it on.\n\nTransfers always pause safely when the system does stop the app — reopen MorseLink and tap Resume.</string>
